// The design of @exact/lists (LLP 1139 D1): the tokens its components'
// params default to. A row is the platform's list cell, so it has no
// spacing of its own; its symbol's tint is the accent, as a UIKit cell
// tints its image, and its switch the platform's on colour. An app sets
// them by full name (the clone sets them to its palette's).
tamber lists

theme
  lists.symbol-tint = AccentColor
  lists.switch-on = -exact-system-green
